<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">1Qoronttoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa Asayis xaafeez tiina Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Qoronttoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Qor.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa Asayis Xaafeez Tiina Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa asayis xaafeez tiina kiitay xaafintteezay, Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa esseez woosa keetha ammaniza asay yessayilannee ammanayil afa denddeez metayis mahith inggodayisii. Ye wode Qoronttoosa katamay biittal yez duma duma asay yez Girike katama Akkaza giz Oroome awurajjas waanna katama. Ye katamita zal7er erintteez, wogar minggeez, duma duma iita yessii dalggeezannee haymaanote darotithar erintteezanno.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaaray miinthii ododayis koyeezay, ye woosa keeth gancce medhintteez shaakintto bagga, duma duma iita yessi bagga, lagita bagga, eko gelo bagga, woosa keeth woga bagga, Geesha Ayyana imotitay baggannee yhayiqoppe denddo bagga. Wonggilay yha oychchita wayizii mahizako hawaaray naaginttii odiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Siiqo Xoossii fa asayis inggeez aadho imota maaqqeezana taphpho hayidzintha shemppay qonccisiza; ma yha shemppay yha maxaafayid ubbapp aadhii erintteez kifile ginttinttii qopinttiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">1Qoronttoosa kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 1:1-9">1:1-9</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniza asay gancce medhintteez shaakintto <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-4:21">1:10—4:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iita hanonnee kara asay yess woga <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 5:1-7:40">5:1—7:40</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniza asannee ammanoowa asa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 8:1-11:1">8:1—11:1</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Woosa keethinnee goynno woga <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 11:2-14:40">11:2—14:40</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa dendonnee ammaniza asay denddo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 15:1-58">15:1-58</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yihuda yez metintteez ammaniza asayis maadee <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 16:5-24">16:5-24</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Xooss shener Yesuus Kiristtoosas hawaare maaqqodayis xeegintteez Phawuloosannee, nu isha Sostenasa, <verse eid="1CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>Qoronttoosa yez Xooss woosa keethis, Yesuus Kiristtoosar geezheezitannee geeshshi maaqqoday garkk xeegintteezitayis; ma unttisinnee nuus God maaqqiz nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa suntha ubba aqo xeegiz ubbayis;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:1">Haw. O. 18:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Xooss, nu Adayippennee nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosapp aadho keehetithinnee sarotith yinttis maaqqo.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Xoossa galatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Xoossay Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggar yinttis inggeez aadho keehatithay gishos taanii ubba wode Xoossa galatiza. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Ezayid odarannee eratith ubbayir yi duriteeza. <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>Taanii Kiristtoosa bagga markkatteezay tuma maaqqeezay yinttal miinggeeza. <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>Yey gishos, yi nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa yi7itha naagttar yezin, aba ayyana imokka yinttis paccenna. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa maaqqiz wode yi boronnee borsso bayth wurssithii hellodayis yinttan miinthii naagoda. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Fa Na7a, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosar pettipettithay yezoday garkk yinttan xeegeez Xoossay ammaninttizaya.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woosa keetha yez shaakintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Ta ishuntho, yi gancce shaakintto yezaamay garkk yi pettii wozinarannee pettii qofar petto maaqqii, yezod garkk nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthayir ta yinttan woosiza. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Ta ishuntho, Qelo7e kara asay yi gancce ixo yezana taas odeeza. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Ta gizay yinttapp pettay pettay, «Taanii Phawuloosas; taanii Aphiloosas; taanii Phixiroosas; taanii Kiristtoosas» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Haw. O. 18:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Kiristtoosa shaakintteenee? Yi gishos mazqalel afa sotintteezay Phawulosanee? Woy yi Phawuloosa sunthayir xammaqintteenenee?<verse eid="1CO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Taanii Qarisphoosannee Gaayoosapp attin yinttipp oonakka xammaqekka gishos Xoossa galatiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:8">Haw. O. 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Haw. O. 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Oro. 16:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>Yey gishos, oonikka yinttan ta sunthayir xammaqintteeza godayis danda7ooya. [ <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Ma Isxeefaanosa kara asakka ta xammaqeeza, zin hara oona xammaqeezako taas qopinttooya.]<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:15">1 Qor. 16:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Kiristtoosa tana kiitteezay Wonggile ododay garkkepp attin xammaqoday garkk baaya. Kiristtoosa mazqalel afa yhayqqeezay cere maaqqaam garkk taanii as ecetith qaalar baaya.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa Xooss wolqqannee ecetith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Kiristtoosa mazqalel afa yhayqqeezana odiza qaalay dhabizitayis boozotithii, zin nuus attizitayis Xooss wolqqa. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Geesha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">«Taanii ecitay ecetitha dhabisoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">akaakanchchitay akaaka balithoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 1:19">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Isa. 29:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Yeezin, eca aba yenee? Higge asitamaare aba yenee? Woy yha sa7a eranchchay aba yenee? Xoossii yha sa7a ecetitha eeyatith oothekkasa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 12:17">Iyo. 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:12">Isa. 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:18">33:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:25">44:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Yha sa7a asay fa ecetethar Xoossa eraamay garkk Xoossii fa ecetithar kayi, boozatithar payidinttiza, nuunii odiza qaalayid ammanizita ashshodayis Xoossa shene maaqqeeza. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Ayihuditay malata be7adayis koyiza; ma Girikitay ecetithi koyiza. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Zin nuunii mazqalel afa sotintteez Kiristtoosa sabbakiza. Yey Ayihuditayis dhube; ma Girikitayis boozetithii. <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>Zin Xoossay xeegeezitayis, Ayihude maaqqin, Girike maaqqin Kiristtoosa Xooss wolqqannee E ecetithii. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Xoossa boozetithay as ecetithaypp aadhiza; ma Xooss daaburay as minotithaypp miinggiza.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Yikkee, ta ishuntho, Xoossay yinttan xeegodar yi ab garkk asizako qoppoytta. As qofar yi gancce gaamitay ecitay, wolqqamitaynnee dhoqqa kochchitay baaya. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Zin Xoossay ecita yeellathodayis alamel yez boozita dooreeza; ma minthita yeellathodayis alamel yez daabureezita dooreeza. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Xoossay yha alamel gita ginttintteezbaz dhabisodayis, yha sa7a kawuzheezibaz, ixintteezibazinnee pathoowabazi dooreeza. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Oonkka Xooss tiina ceeqinttaamay garkk yeya ootheeza. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Zin Xoossay yinttis Kiristtoosa Yesuusar pettipettithar yezod garkk ootheeza. E nuus Xoossapp ecetith, xillotith, geeshshetithinnee wallotith maaqqeeza. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Yey gishos, Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Ceeqinttiza oonikka Godayil ceeqqo» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Erim. 9:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Sotintteez Kiristtoosa bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Ta ishuntho, taanii tiina Xoossa qaala yinttis oditattar ye7eez wode doona biilamotitharannee ecetithar ye7ekkaya. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Taanii yinttar yeza wode mazqalel afa sotintteez Yesuus Kiristtoosapp attin hara baz eraami gi ta murtteeza. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Ta yinttar yez wode daaburar, yashsharannee kukkurisar yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:9">Haw. O. 18:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Ta kiitannee ta timirtta doona biilamotitharannee ecetithar baazin Geeshsha Ayyana wolqqa qonccisithara. <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>Yeykka, yi ammanay Xoossa wolqqayirapp attin as ecetithal katamay garkkesii.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss ecetitha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Ayyana de7or dicceezitayis nuunii ecetith qaalar odiza. Zini yha ecetithay, yha sa7a ecetith woy dhaboss yez yha sa7a haarizitay ecetith baaya. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Zini nuunii odiza ecetithay, gaame wodepp tiina Xoossay nu bonchchayis giigiseezannee geema yez xuura ecetithii. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Yha sa7a haarizitaypp pettakka yha ecetitha erekkaya. Unttii ereezbaz maaqqeezako, bonchcho Goda mazqalel afa sottaamizin. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Zini Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">«Aafe be7ekka baz,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">haye si7ekkabaz,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">wozina qoppekkabaz,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">Xoossay fa dosizitayis giigiseeza» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Isa. 64:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Xoossay fa xuura fa Ayyana baggar nuus qoncciseeza. Geeshsha Ayyanay hara attozin geemmeez Xooss xuura ubba pilagiza. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>As gancce yez as ayyannpp attin asibaz ookka erooya. Yey garkkekka, Xoossi baz Xooss Ayyanapp attin ookka erooya. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Xoossay nuus cere inggeezibaz nu eroday garkk Xoossa Ayyana ekkeezapp attin yha sa7a ayyana ekkekkaya.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Nuunii ayyana baz, ayyana asayis as ecetithar baazin Xooss Ayyanay inggiza ecetithar taamarssiza. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Zini Geeshsha Ayyana baa as Xooss Ayyana imotita ekkaamii. Yey ees boozetithii; ubbay Geeshsha Ayyanar pilaginttiz gishos E erodayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Zini Geeshsha Ayyana yez asii ubba baz pilagiza, zin eza ookka pilagooya. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">«Goda wozina erizay oonoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Eza zorodayis danda7izay oonoo?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">ginttinttii xaafintteezay garkke. Nuus Kiristtoosa wozina yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa. 40:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Qoronttoosa woosa keeth medhintteez shaakotith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Ta ishuntho, yi asho asinnee Kiristtoosar haga ochchekka duude na7a garkk yez gishos taanii ayyana baz yinttis ododayis danda7ekkaya. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Yi miinth katha maadayis danda7ekka gishos taanii yinttan maathi pakeeza; yhattekka yi danda7ekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:12-13">Ibr. 5:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>Yhattekka yi ammanoowa as garkk yeza. Yi gancce yez qinaataynnee woli ixayi ammanoowa as garkk yezana erisoosa? Yi ammanoowa as garkk haniza. <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Yinttapp pettay, «Taanii Phawuloosas» haray ma, «Taanii Aphiloosas» giiko, ammanoowa as garkk baasannee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">1 Qor. 1:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Yeezin, Aphiloosa abba? Phawuloosa abba? Nuunii yinttan ammantheez Xooss oosanchchita. Xoossay pettayis pettayis inggeez oosay garkk oothiza oosanchchita baasannee? <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Ta tukkeeza; Aphiloosa haath ushsheeza, zini dichcheezay Xoosse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:4-11">Haw. O. 18:4-11</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 18:24-28">24-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Yey gishos, dichcheez Xoossaypp attin tukkizaykka haath ushshizaykka akkokka baaya. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Tukkithinnee haathe ushsho wol garkke, zin pettay pettay fa oosaygarkk Xoossay inggiza woyita ekkoda. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Nuunii pettipp Xoossayis oothiza eez oosanchchita maaqqeez gishos yi Xooss ooso gade; Xooss keethe. <verse eid="1CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Xoossay taas inggeez aadho keehatithaygarkk hiillanchcho anaaxe garkk baaso baaseeza. Haray athay ezal afa keexxiza. Zini ezal afa keexxiza oonkka wayizii keexxizako, faasa naagintto. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Pettii toke baasintteez baasaypp hara baaso baasodayis oonkka danda7ooya. Ye baasaykka Yesuus Kiristtoosa. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Zini yha baasayil afa oonkka worqqar woy birar maaqqin, al7o shuchchar woy mithar maaqqin, matar woy hawuler keexxiko, <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>pettii pettii as ye baasayil afa abar keexxeezakko pirdda gallas tamar paacintt erinttoda. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Oonkka ye baasayil afa keexxeez keethay tamar xuuginttekka attiko, fa woyita ekkoda. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Zini o oosoykka tamar xuugnttiko, ye athayis woyito baaya. Hano zin, E fa ommas tamapp buutii kezeez as garkk attoda.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Yi Xooss keeth maaqqeezannee Xooss Ayyanay yinttara yezana erekkasa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:19">1 Qor. 6:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Qor. 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Oonkka Xooss keetha laaliko, Xoossikka eza laaloda. Xooss keethay geeshshii; ye keethaykka yinttana.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Oonkka fana dooshshippe. Yha sa7a ecetethar fana eca udii ekkiz oonkka Xooss tiina eca maaqqodayis boozo maaqqo. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Yha sa7a ecatithay Xooss tiina boozetithii. Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 3:19">«Xoossii ecita u gene qofayir aykkoda» yeegintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Iyo. 5:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>Ma, «Ecitay qofay maaddowabaz maaqqeezana Goday eriza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 3:20">yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Maz. 94:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Yey gishos, ubbay yinttis maaqqeez gishos oonkka asal ceeqinttipp. <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>Phawuloosa maaqqo, Aphiloosannee Phixiroosa maaqqo, yha alama maaqqo, de7o maaqqo, yhayiqo maaqqo, yhatti yezaya maaqqin, tiinapp ye7od ubbay yinttisii. <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>Yi Kiristtoosasii; Kiristtoosakka Xoossisii.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa hawaarita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Asay nuna Kiristtoosa aylle Xooss xuure qonccisodayis hadara inggintteez as garkk udii qoppo. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Ye hadara ekkeez asitay fa Godayis ammanintteezita maaqqodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Zin yinttii woy haray tana pirddiko, taas akkokka baaya. Haray atto, taakka taal afa pirddaamii. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Ta erizay garkk maaqqiko ta kahay kaccooya, yeykka ta folo geeshsha maaqqeezana beezooya. Taal afa pirddoday Goday aadda. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Yey gishos, wode hellekkazin, Goday ye7odaypp tiina oollakka pirddipate. E dhuma geenggeez xuura poo7o kessoda; as wozina qosintteez qofa qonccisoda. Ye wode pettay pettay Xoossaypp galata ekkoda.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Ta ishuntho, yi gishos gi Aphiloosanannee tana aaziso udii yinttis odeeza. Yeya ta ootheezay, «Xaafintteezaypp aadhippe» yeegii zorizana yi nuupp tamaaroday garkkesii. Yey gishos, oonkka petta gayrinttor yhankka kadhodayis beezooya. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Ne yhankkitaypp abar aadhinee? Neenii ekkekkabaz abii yenee? Yeezin, neenii ekkeezbaz hara asaypp ekkeez maaqqiko, ekkekka as garkk abis ceeqinttinnee?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Yhatti yinttis beeziza baz ubba yi ekkeeza. Yhatti yi duritteeza. Nu bayth yi aadda kawuteeza. Yi tuma kawuteezbaz maaqqeezako, nuukka yinttar kawutodazin. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Xoossay nuna hawaarita, yhayqqos pirddintteez as garkk as ubbapp nuna guye aatheeza taas aaziza. Nuunii yha alamayis, kiitanchchitayisinnee asayis kaassibaz maaqqeeza.<verse eid="1CO 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Nuunii Kiristtoosa gishos boozo maaqqeez, zin yi Kiristtoosar ecita maaqqeeza. Nuunii daabura, zin yi miinth maaqqeeza. Yi bonchchintteeza, zin nuunii tooshintteeza. <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Yhanno hellodayis nu nayinttiza, saaminttiza, kallottiza, yhadhinttiza; yezod kamppa dhabin kaa7inttiza. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>Nuunii nu kusher yhanttar aqod gi daaburiza. Nuna asii baaddodar nu anjjiza; nuna bayi7ithodar nu garzhiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Haw. O. 18:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>Nuul afa iita baz odinttiza wode lo77o qaala nu mahiza. Nu yhanno hellodayis yha alame pixabazinnee wora wodhdheez buure maaqqeeza.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Taanii yeya xaafizay, ta siiqiza na7itay garkk, yinttan zorodayis xaafeezaypp attin yeellasodayis baaya. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Kiristtoosar yinttan kaalithiza payidop aathii yezikokka, gaame aditay baaya. Ta yinttan Kiristtoosa Yesuusa Wonggilayir yeleeza. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Yikkee, yi tana aaziso udii kaallod garkk yinttan woosiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:1">1 Qor. 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Filp. 3:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Yeyi gishos, ammanintteez, ta siiqiza, Goday baggar ta na7a, Ximaatoosa yinttiko azazeeza. E duma duma aqo yez woosa keetha ta taamarsseez, Kiristtoosa Yesuusar yez ta oga yinttan qofisoda.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Taanii yinttiko ye7aambaz aazin, utirttiza pettii pettii asitay yeza. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Zini Goday giiko, ukkera taanii yinttiko ye7oda. Ye wode utiranchchitay oda aadda baazin unttis aba wolqqakka yezako ta eroda. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Xooss kaatetithay oda aadda baazin Xooss wolqqa. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Taanii yinttiko gufera yhanigone siiqorannee haayo ayyanara yhanigo? Yi aaya doorinee?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammaniza as gancce yez yeellathiza ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Yi gancce lagite yezay zigirinttiza. Yey garkk lagita hara attozin, ammanoowa asaykka oothooya. Yi gancce fa ade machchira tuneez asii yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:30">Nam7i. 22:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Yeezin yi qiiradhodayisinnee yeellatodayis beeziza, zin utirttiza. Yey garkk borsso baz ootheez atha yi ganccepp kessodayis beezoosa?<verse eid="1CO 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Taanii ashor yinttar yezaam ixxikokka ayyanar ta yinttar yeza. Taanii yinttar yez as garkk hanii yey garkk oosa ootheez athayil afa pirddeeza. <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa sunthar yi shiiqodar taanii ayyanar yinttar yezoda. Ezayid Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa wolqqay yinttar maaqqoda. <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>Ye athay nagara ashay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nagara ashay: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nagara medhay woy nagara asetithay.</char></note> dhabin, e ayyanay Goda Yesuusa pirdda gallas attoday garkk e Xalahes aadhii inggintto.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Yi gayirinttay lo77o baaya. Xiqqa irshsho munuqo ubba denthizana yi eroosa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:9">Gal. 5:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Yi yhatti irshsho baa munuqo maaqqoday garkk, nagara irshsho yinttapp kessoytta. Nuus Paaziqa dur maaqqeez Kiristtoosa yarshshintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:5">Kes. 12:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Yeyi gishos, genennee iitatithii yez irshshor baazin tumatitharannee geeshshatithi yez boorar nu baale bonchchoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:7">Kes. 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:3">Nam7i. 16:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Ta tiina xaafeez dabddaabbayid yi lagitiza asana hellaamay garkk yinttis odeeza. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Yeya guussay yha alamel yez lagitizita woy nagaras tenttotizita woy suuqqatizta woy bonqqizita woy eeqas goynnizita ubbar hellipate guuss baaya. Yeya maaqqiko, yha alamaypp yi kezodayis beeziza zin atteeza. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Zini ammaniza giinttii lagitizita woy tenttotiza woy eeqas goynnizitayir woy cazhizitayir woy mathizitayir woy bonqqizitayir wol hellippate gi yinttis odiza. Yey garkk asayira hara attozin, kathakka miipatte.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Woosa keethapp baler yezitayil afa pirddodayis tana abi helthee? Woosa keetha yezitayil afa yi pirddoosanee? <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Zini balera yezitayil afa Xooss pirddoda. Ye iita baz oothiz atha yi ganccepp kessoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:5">Nam7i. 13:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:7">17:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammaniza asay gancce yez mooto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Yi ganccepp pettay pettayir mooto yezako, yeya ammaniza asay tiina pirddinttodana ashshii ammanoowa as tiina pirddinttodayis wayizii beezee? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Geeshshitay alamel afa pirddodana yi eroosa? Yeezin, yi alamel afa pirddiza baz maaqqiko, yhay garkk xiqqabaz pirddodayis wayizii danda7inttoosa? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Nuunii kiitanchchitayil afa pirddodana yi eroosa? Yeezin, yha sa7a yessal afa pirddodayis yinttan wayizii gaame? <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Yeezin, yey garkk meto yi gancce medhinttiko, woosa keethi pettipettethapp baler yezitaykonnee borintteez asay tiina pirddinttodayis wayizii kanggee? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Taanii yinttan yeellasodayis yeya giza. Yi gancce kacintteez asita inggithodayis danda7iza akaakiza asii baasa? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Yeezin, pettii ammaniza ishay yhankko ammaniza ishanna pirdda keeth ammanoowa asay tiina mootodayis beezinee?<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Yikkee, yi pettay petta mootizabaz maaqqiko yeyi yi pokitha beeziza. Yeypp yi qohinttikonnee dooshinttiko lo77aamo? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Zini yi woli gancce ammanizitay pettay petta qohizannee dooshshiza, yeykka yi ishita.<verse eid="1CO 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Worzhitay Xooss kaatetitha laattaamana yi eroosa? Yinttan dooshipate; tenttotizitayinnee lagitizitay woy eeqa goynnizitay woy qayxinttizitay woy dhiirathii dhiirathar peezhizitay, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>woy kayzitay woy uuzitay woy mathizitay woy cazhitay woy bonqizitay Xooss kaatetitha laattaamii. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Yinttapp pettii pettii asay tiina yey garkke. Zini yi yhatti Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa suntharannee Xooss Ayyanar meecintteeza; geezheeza; xilleeza.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yi asetithayir Xooss bonchchoytta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>«Taas ubba baz inggintteeza» Zini ubbay tana adamii. «Taas ubba baz inggintteeza», zin abikka tana haaraamii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:23">1 Qor. 10:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>«Katha ulos; ulokka kathas» Zini Xoossay ulokka kathakka dhabisodana ta yinttis odiza. Nu asetithay Godayssipp attin lagitas baaya. Godaykka nu asetithayisii. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Xoossay Goda yhayiqopp dentheezay garkk, nunakka yhayiqopp fa wolqqar denthoda.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Yi asetithay Kiristtoosa asetithaypp bagga maaqqeezana eroosanee? Yeezin, taanii Kiristtoosa asetithaypp bagga kanggii lagita asetithi maaqqoday garkk udo? Hanena! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Lagitiza athay e peezhiz asttira pettii asetith maaqqeezana yi eroosa? Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Unttii nam7ay pettii asetithi maaqqoda» ginttintt xaafintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Medhe. 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Zini Godayra pettipiza athay ezar ayyanarakka petto maaqqiza.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Lagitapp haakkoytta. Pettii athay oothiz hara nagara e asetithapp balera oosinttiza, zin lagitiza as fa asetithayil nagara oothiza. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Yi asetithay Xoossay yinttis inggeez yinttar yez Geeshsha Ayyana kara maaqqeezana yi eroosanee? Yi yinttis baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Qor. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Qor. 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>Xoossay yinttan gater wonggeeza. Yeyi gishos, yi asetithayir Xooss bonchchoytta.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Eko gelo bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Yi taas xaafeez dabiddaabbay bagga as maachch bochchaaminxikko lo77o. <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Zini lagitapp attodayis pettay pettay machcho paas ekko; ma pettii pettii machchiskka azin yezo.<verse eid="1CO 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Azinay fa machchis, ma machchat fa azinayis beeziza baz udo. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Machchat fa asetithayil afa iis mawute baaya, zin mawute I azinayisi. Yey garkkekka, azinayis E asetithayil afa mawute baaya, zin mawutay machchatisi. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Yi woosar xiqqa wode gam7odayis zorer maaqqaam ixxiko, pettay petta kayppate. Yeypp denddeezayid yinttinatitha haarodayis gaminttin, Xalahe yinttan paaccaamay garkk pettipp yezoytta. <verse eid="1CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Zini taanii yinttan zorodayis yhaya geezaypp attin azazo baaya. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Asii ubbay ta garkk machcho ekkeka yezizako ta dosiza, zin Xoossay pettayis pettayis inggeez duma duma imotay yeza. Pettayis yhaygarkk yhankkayis hara imotay yeza.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Machcho ekkekkazitayisinnee azin gelekkazitayis ma am7itayis taanii gizay, ta garkk yezoytta gi zoriza. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Zini amor xuuginttodaypp ekkizaynnee gelizay lo77o maaqqeez gishos unttii fana haarodayis danda7aam ixxiko, ekkonne gelo.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Taanii ekkeezitayisinnee geleezitayis yhay garkk gi zoriza; tana baaya Goday azaziza; machchat fa azinaypp shaakinttippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat. 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:9">19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luq. 16:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>Zini shaakinttiko hara azina gelekka fa ubbas yezo woy fa azinayira giigo. Azinay fa machchat billippe.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Zini yhankkitayis Goda baazin taanii yhay garkk giza. Ammanoowa machcha yez ammaniza azinay yeziko, machchat ezar pettipp yezodayis koyko izo billippe. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Ma ammanoowa azinii yez ammaniza machcha yeziko, I azinay iir pettipp yezodayis koyko eepp bilinttippee. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Ammanoowa azinay fa ammaniza machchat baggar geezhiza; ma ammanoowa machchat fa ammaniza azinay baggar geezhiza. Yeya baazako, yi na7itay tuna maaqqiza, zin yhatti unttii geeshshii. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Zini ammanoowa azina woy machchat billodayis koyko billo. Ammaniza machcha woy azinay yey garkk bazar acinttippe. Xoossay nuna sarotithar yezoday garkk xeegeeza. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Ammaniza astte, ammanoowa ne azinay ne baggar ammanodazako ne erinee? Woy ammaniza athayyo, ammanoowa ne machchat ne baggar ammanodazako ne erinee?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Pettii pettii as Goday ees inggeez imotay garkkennee Xoossay eza xeegeezay garkk yeza. Woosa keeth ubbayid taanii taamarsseez wogay yhaya. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Oonkka dookalinttii xeegintteezibaz maaqqiko, dookalintteekazay garkk hanippee. Dooaolintteka ammaneez oonkka yeziko, dookalinttodayis koyppe. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Xooss kiita polodayis beezizaypp attin dookalinttin dookalinttaam ixxin akkosikka adooya.<verse eid="1CO 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Pettii pettii as Xoossay fana xeegeez wode yezan garkk yeza. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Xoossay nena xeegeez wode neenii aylle? Akkokka baaya yeyiss un77inttippe. Zini neenii aylletithapp wozinttodayis danda7iko wozinttoba. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Aylle maaqqii yezar Godar xeegintteez as Godaypp denddeezayid aylletithapp wozintteeza. Yey garkkekka, aylle maaqqekka yezar, Godayir xeegintteez as Kiristtoosa aylle. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Xoossay yinttan gate ciggi wongeez gishos as aylle maaqqipatte. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Ta ishuntho, yi pettay pettay xeegintteez wode yez yessayir Xoossar wolla yezoytta.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekkekka, gelekka asay baggannee am7itay bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Wudiritayinnee paanthitay bagga Goday tana azazeez bazi baaya. Zini Goday taas inggeez maarotithay garkk taanii yinttan zoriza. <verse eid="1CO 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Yikkee, yha wodayid yez metay gishos ekkeka woy gelekka yessi taas lo77o aaziza. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Ne machcho ekkeez baz maaqqiko, anjjodayis koyppe. Ne machcho ekkekkabaz maaqqiko, ekkodayis koyppe. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Zini ne machcho ekkiko nagara baaya. Yey garkk wudirttakka azin geliko nagara baaya. Zini ekkiza geliza asayis yha sa7a iita meto yeza gishos yi yeypp attoday garkk ta koyiza.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Ta ishuntho, ta gizay yeya; wode wureeza. Yikkepp tiina machcha yezay machcho ekkekkazay garkk yezo. <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>Yeekkizitay yeekkoozitay garkk maaqqo, ufayttizitay ufayttoozitay garkk, wonggizitay akkokka baazitay garkk fana payido. <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>Yha sa7a shalor maadinttinttizitay maaddinttoozitay garkk maaqqo. Yha alame malay aadhoda.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Yi hirgga bayth yezoday garkk ta dosiza. Machcho ekkekazay Goda ufayssodayis koyiz gishos Godaybaz qoppiza. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Zini machcho ekkeezay fa machchato ufayssodayis koyiz gishos yha sa7abaz qoppiza. <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>E qofay nam77ii aqo shaakinttiza. Azin gelekka wudirtta fa asetithayrannee fa shemppayid geezhii Goda ufayssodayis koyeez gishos Godaybaz qoppiza. Zini azin geleezana fa azina ufayssodayis koyiz gishos sa7abaz qoppiza.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Taanii yeya yinttis odeeza, yi maadinttoday garkkepp attin xike gancce gelii yi un77inttoday garkk baaya. Zini yi qofay laalinttekka maarar yezii Goda ufayssiza baz yi udod garkk taanii odiza.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Oonkka fa oycceez wudirtto gelo wode aadheeza gi izo ashshodayis qoppiko, yeyi ma iis lo77o baazay si7inttiko, fa koyeeza ootho; u woli ekkiko, geliko; yey nagara baaya. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Zini pettii as un77ithiza baz dhabiko, fa wozinayir miinggii, fana haarii, fa oycceez wudirtto ekkeka ashshodayis koykko lo77o udeeza. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Yeyi gishos, wudirttona ekkeez athay lo77o ootheeza; ma ekkeka athay ubbar lo77o ootheeza.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Machchata azinay paxa yez wode ubbayid ezar accintteezano. Zini I azinay yhayqqiko, fa doseez azina gelodayis danda7iza. Hano zin, iza geliza athay ammaniza as maaqqodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Ta qofar maaqqiko, iza gelekka yeziko ufayisar yezoda. Ma taas, taar Xoossa Ayyana yeza aaziza.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Eeqas yarshshintteez katha bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Eeqas yarshshintteez katha bagga maaqqiko nu ubbay eriza. Eratithii utirssiza, zin siiqo dichchiza. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Oonkka fana eriza gi qoppiko, E haga erodayis beezizay garkk haga erekkaya. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Zini oonkka Xooss siiqiko E Xooss kantta erintteezaya.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Yeyi gishos, eeqas yarshshintteez katha muussibagga maaqqiko yha alamel Godi pettii Xoossaypp attin hara baa gishos eeqa pathoowa baz maaqqeezana nuunii eriza. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Xooss baazar salorannee sa7ar Xoosse ginttinttii xeeginttiz gaame Xoossitayinnee goditay yezikokka, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>ubba baz medhdheez, nu E baz maaqqeez, pettii Xoossay, Aday aadda, nuus yeza. Ubbay E baggar medhintteeza, nuukka E baggar yeziz pettii Goday, Yesuus Kiristtoosa nuus yeza.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Zini yeya erizitay ubbita baaya. Pettii pettii asay eeqa goynniza gishos katha miiz wode eeqas yarshshintteez baz udii ekkiza. Ye wode u kahay daabura maaqqeez gishos tuniza. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Zini katha nuna Xoossar dabbothooya. Nu maam ixxiko akkokka qohinttaamii; ma miikokka maaddaamii.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Zini yi koyeez baz maadayis mawute yinttis yezikoka yeyi ammanor minggekkazita dhubbaamay garkk naaginttoytta. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Neenii nena eranchcho gi eeqas yarshshintteez katha maadayis eeqa kara betteezin, ammanor minggeekazay nena bi7iko yeyi eza eeqas yarshshintteez katha maaday garkk denthithoosanee? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Yikkee, ne eratithaypp denddeezayid Kiristtoosa e gishos yhayqqeez, ammanor minggeka ne ishay, dhabiza. <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Yey garkk udii, ammanor minggekka yi ishita qohitarannee u kaha suuthitar Kiristtoosana qohiza. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Yeyi gishos, katha ta isha dhubbizabaz maaqqiko, E dhubinttaamay garkk asho yesha maamii.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Hawaaritay mawute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Taanii mawuter yeza as baasannee? Ta hawaare baasannee? Taanii nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa be7ekkasanee? Godayir yi ta daabura aafe baasannee? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Yi Godayibaz maaqqeez gishos ta yhankkitayis hawaare maaqqaam ixxikokka, yinttis hawaare maaqqithayis yi markka.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Tana hawaare baaya giz asayis ta inggiza mahithay yhaya. <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>Nu maadayisinnee uzhodayis tuma nuus mawute baasannee? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Yhankko hawaaritay garkkennee, Goday ishitay garkk, Phixiroosa garkk, ammaniza nu machchita ekkii yedhdhodayis nuus mawute baasa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Woy oothor aqodayis beezizay taarannee Barnnabaasa aadda? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Fa miishayir wotaaddaretithi oothizay oonoo? Woy woyne tukkii, ezaypp aafe moozay oonoo? Woy wude heenggittar, ye wudaypp maathi uzhoozay oonoo?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Taanii yeya as qofa garkk ginene? Higge yeya gin baasa? <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Muse Higgayid, «Wudumma katha bukkiza gemate doona accippe» ginttintt xaafintteeza. Yeezin Xoossay yeya gematayis qoppii yeya geenee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Nam7i. 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Xim. 5:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Xoossay yeya geezay nuus qoppii baasannee? Ee nu gishosii. Biita oothizayika, katha geeshshizaykka fana heliza gisha ekkod gi ufayisar oothodayis beeziza giinttintteezay tuma nu gishos xaafintteeza. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Nuunii yi gancce ayyana zerith zereez maaqqiko ashos beeziza baz nu yinttipp maxiko, yeyi dama bazonee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:27">Oro. 15:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Yhankkitay yeya yinttipp ekkodayis unttis mawute yeziko, nuus unttiisaypp aath mawute yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat. 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luq. 10:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Zini nuunii Kiristtoosa Wonggiles dhube maaqqaam garkk, ubba garzhinepp attin ye mawutayir maadinttekkaya. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Xooss kara oothiza asitay fa katha Xooss Karapp ekkizannee Ma yarshsho aqo oothizitay yarshsholapp ekkii miizana yi eroosanee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Nam7i. 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Xim. 5:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Yey garkkekka, Wonggile markkattizitay yessis beeziza baz Wonggilaypp ekkoday garkk Goday azazeeza.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Zin taanii yha mawute ubbitayid akkokka maadinttekkaya. Taanii yhaya xaafeezay ta mawute bonchchisodayis koyii baaya. Oonkka ta ceeqa cere ashshodaypp yhayiqo taas lo77o. <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Taanii Wonggile odizay kiitintteez gishosap attin tana ceeqisizabaz baaya. Wonggile odaam ixxiko, tana ayye. <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Taanii Wonggile dosor sabbakiko taas woyito yeza. Zini taanii Wonggile dosekka azazinttii sabbakizabaz maaqqiko yeya ta hadara poleenepp attin hara ta ootheez baz baaya. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Yeezin, ta woyitay abba? Taanii Wonggile sabbakiza wode ta mawuter maaddinttekka Wonggile damooze bayth cere sabbakizay taas woyito.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Taanii ooskka aylle baaya, zin gaamita ashshodayis ubbayis aylle maaqqeeza. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Taanii Ayihudita ashshodayis unttar unttan maaqqeeza. Ta ommas higgepp oommor baaya, zin higgepp oommor yezita ashshodayis higgepp oommo yez as maaqqeeza. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Xooss higgaypp bale kezekka, Kiristtoosa higgayis kiitinttittar, higge baazita ashshodayis higge baa as garkk ta maaqqeeza. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Taanii daabureezita ashshodayis daabura maaqqeeza. Taanii xiqqa asita ashshodayis ubbayir ubba maaqqeeza. <verse eid="1CO 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Taanii Wonggile anjjo shaakinttodayis, yha ubba Wonggile gishos haneeza.<verse eid="1CO 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Laaso aalaliz ubbay laasiza, zin pettay aadda woyito ekkizana eroosanee? Yey garkk yinttikka woyita ekkodayis laasoytta. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Laasiza as ubbay ubba bazar fana haariza. Unttii yeya daaburzay dhabod zawude woyito ekkodayisii. Zini nuunii daaburizay medhina zawude woyita ekkodayisii. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Yeyi gishos, taanii qofa baa as garkk laasaam. Carkko zhulitiz as garkk cere kushe dakkaamii. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Zini taanii harayis Wonggile sabbakeezaypp guye ta ommas wodhdheez as maaqqaamay garkk ta asetitha wolqqar zhulitittar taas azazinttoday garkk udiza.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Eeqas goynnaamay garkk naagiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Ta ishuntho, taanii yi yhaya akaakoday garkk koyiza. Nu aditay ubbay shaara kaalithin shaara oommora yedheeza; ubbay abba piinggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Kes. 13:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:22-29">14:22-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Unttii Musera pettippodayis shaararannee abba xammaqintteeza. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Unttii ubbay pettii ayyana katha meeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Kes. 16:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>Ma ubbay pettii ayyana ushsh uzheeza. Unttan kaalliza ayyana zaallap pultteez ushsha uzheeza; ye zaallaykka Kiristtoosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Kes. 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:11">Tay. 20:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Zini Xoossay unttapp gaamitayil ufayttekkazay gishos u ahay liizho demba wodhdhii atteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29-30">Tay. 14:29-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Unttii iita baz amotteezay garkk, nuukka iita baz amottamay garkk yeyi ubbay nuus aaziso maaqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 11:4">Tay. 11:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Asay maadayisinnee uzhodayis betteeza; ma yexxodayis denddeeza» ginttintteezay garkk unttapp pettay pettay eeqa goynneezay garkk yi eeqa goynnippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Kes. 32:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Unttapp pettay pettay laammeezay garkk nuukka nagara ootho. Yeypp denddeezayid unttapp pettii gallas laatamannee hayidzii mukulo as yhayqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-18">Tay. 25:1-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Unttapp pettay pettay Goda paaccii shooshar dukinttii yhayqqeezay garkk nu Goda faaccodayis beezooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:5-6">Tay. 21:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Unttapp pettay pettay olii yhayiqo ki7iz kiitanchchayir dhabeezay garkk yinttikka oollippate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:41-49">Tay. 16:41-49</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Yha unttal afa helleez ubbay nu naaginttoday garkk nuus aaziso maaqqeeza. Ma wode wurssithal afa yez nuus timirtte maaqqoday garkk yha ubbay xaafintteeza.<verse eid="1CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Yeyi gishos, eqqeeza aaziz oonkka pokkaamay garkk fana naago. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Asi ubba heliza paacepp attin duma paace yinttan hellekkaya. Yi wolqqay danda7izaypp aath paacer yi paacinttaamay garkk aathii inggowa Xoossay ammanintteezaya. Yinttan paace heliza wode ye paacayid E yinttan danda7isoda. Ma ye paacaypp yi kezod oga E giigisoda.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Yikkee, ta al7o ishuntho, eeqa goynnopp haakkoytta. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Yi kahaama as maaqqeez gishos ta yhaya odiza. Taanii gizay tuma maaqqeezana yi yi ubbas pirddoytta. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Nuunii Xooss galatii shaakinttiza anjjo xuu7ay Kiristtoosa suuthar pettipettethi yeza baasannee? Ma nuunii miiz booray Kiristtoosa ashayira pettipettithii yeza baasannee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mat. 26:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-24">Mar. 14:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:19-20">Luq. 22:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Nuunii gaame maaqqikokka booray petto, nu ye pettii boora shaakinttiza gishos pettii asetithii.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>An Isreele asay ootheeza akaakoytta. Yarshshintteez yarshsho miizitayis Yarshsho bessayira pettipettithii baasannee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:6">Lewii. 7:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Taanii ab godayis koyii ginee? Eeqas yarshshintteez kathay woy eeqay pathizabaz guusonnee? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Wa77a, Unttii yarshshizay Xoossis baazin tuna ayyanitayisii. Yeyi gishos, yinttis tuna ayyaanitayra pettipettithii yezoday garkk ta koyooya. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Yi Goday xuu7aypp uzhittar, ma tuna ayyanitay xuu7aypp uzhodayis yi danda7ooya. Goda gaytaypp miittar ma tuna ayyanitay gaytaypp maadayis danda7oowa. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Nu yeya udii Goda shentho? Nu minotithar eepp aadhinenee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Nam7i. 32:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>Yi «Ubba baz nuus inggintteeza» zin ubbay adooya. «Ubba baz nuus inggintteeza» giza zin ubba baz adooya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:12">1 Qor. 6:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Pettii pettii as, hara as maaddiza baz qoppodayis beezinepp attin fana maaddiza baz aadda qoppippe.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Yi kahayid sidhe medhdhiza haasii gabell bayizinttiza asho si77i gi moytta. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Abis giiko, «Sa7annee sa7all yez ubbay Godayisii.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Maz. 24:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Pettii ammanoowa as yinttan imatos koy xeegiko yhanigodayis koyko yhanigoytta. Yi kahayid sidhekka yi tiina aathizabaz ubba moytta. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Zini pettii as, «Yhay eeqas yarshintteez bazii» giiko, ye yinttis odeez athay gishonnee e kahay gishos ye katha miipatte. <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Taanii, kaha gishos gi yinttis odizay athay kaha ginepp attin yi kaha baaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Hara as kaha gishos gi taanii ta wallotithayil abis pirddo? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Taanii miiz katha Xooss galatii miiko balintteezaya garkk abis borinttodee?<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Yikkee, yi ab miiko ab uzhiko, woy ab oothikokka ubba baz Xooss bonchchos oothoytta. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Ayihudita maaqqin Girikita maaqqin woy Xooss woosa keetha maaqqin ooskka dhube maaqqipatte. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>Taanii ubba wode gaamita ashshodayis unttii maaddinttiza oge koyinepp attin tana maaddiza oge koyooya.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Taanii Kiristtoosa aazizay garkk, yinttikka tana aazoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:16">1 Qor. 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Filp. 3:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goynno woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Yi ubba bazar tana qoppiza gishonnee ta taamarsseez timirttita miinthii naageez gishos ta yinttan galatiza. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Zini Kiristtoosa dhiirathi ubbitayis omma, dhiirathi maachchis omma, ma Xoossay Kiristtoosas omma maaqqeezana yi eroday garkk ta koyiza. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Fa omma guulunttii Xooss woossiza woy tinbbite odiza diirithi ubbay omma maaqqeez Kiristtoosa toochchiza. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Fa omma qacekka Xooss woossiza woy tinbbite odiz maachchat kustte maaqqeez fa azina toochchiza. Fa omma qacekka maachchat fa omma meedintteez maachch as garkk fayidinttiza.<verse eid="1CO 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Maachch asii fa omma qacaam ixxiko, fa omma gachintto. Zini iis omma gachcho woy meedo borsso baz maaqqiko fa omma qaco. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Dhiirathii Xooss aazisonnee Xooss bonchcho maaqqeez gishos fa omma qacodayis beezooya, zin maachchii dhiirath bonchcho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26-27">Medhe. 1:26-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Maachchii dhiirathapp medhintteezapp attin dhiirathi maachchapp medhinttibekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:18-23">Medhe. 2:18-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Maachch as dhiirathis medhinttezapp attin dhiirathii maachchis medhinttekkaya. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Yhay gishonnee kiitanchchitay gishos maachch asii paas mawute yezana beeziza malla fa omma qacodayis beeziza.<verse eid="1CO 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Zini Goday qofayid maachch asii dhiirth bayith yezaamii; dhiirathikka maachchi bayth yezaamii. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Maachch asii dhiirathapp medhintteezay garkk dhiirathikka maachchapp yelintteeza. Zini ubbaykka Xoossapp medhintteeza.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>An yi pirddoytta. Maachchii fa omma qacekka Xooss woossodayis beezinee? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Dhiirathii fa omma dichchiko ees borsso maaqqeezana hara attozin medhetithii tamaarssosanee? <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>Zini maachchii fa omma dichchiko iis bonchcho baasannee? Maachchis omma inggintteezay iza fana kammoday garkke. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Zini yhayil afa palamodayis koyeez as yeziko, nuus maaqqin woy Xooss woosa keethitayis maaqqin yhaypp hara woga baaya.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday kaho ekkiza maara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mat. 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mar. 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luq. 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Yi pettipp shiiqizay maaddiza baz baazin qohiza maaqqeez gishos yhatti ta inggiza azazayid yinttan nashichchaamii. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Ta tiina si7eezay, yi woosa keetha shiiqodar yi gancce shaakotithii yeza. Yeya ta si7eezaypp baggay tuma maaqqeezana ta ammaniza. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Yi ganccepp tumar yezitay oonanttazako erinttoday garkk yi gancce shaako yessi attaamii. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Yi pettipp shiiqiza wode yi shiiqii miizay Goday kaho baaya. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Yi katha miiz wode pettay petta naagekka paasa paasa miiz gishos pettay nayinttiza yhankkay ma mathiza. <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Tuma yi maadayssinnee uzhodayis yinttis kara baasa? Woy Xooss woosa keeth kadhinee? Akkokka baa manqqita yeellathodayisonnee? Ta yinttan waago? Yhayir ta yinttan nashichcho? Nashichchaamii.<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Taanii yinttis inggeez timirttita Godaypp ekkeeza. Goda Yesuusa aadhii ingginttiz qamma boora ekkii, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>Xooss galat. Boora baxxii «Yashitte; moytta. Yhay yinttis ingginttiza ta asho. Yhaya miittar tana qopoytta» yeegeeza. <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Yey garkkekka, kaha mi maaqqin, xuu7a ekkii, «Yha xuu7ay ta suuthar caaqiz oroth caaqo. Yi ezaypp uzhitar ubba wode tana qopoytta» yeegeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Kes. 24:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Erim. 31:31-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Yi yha boora miiz wodennee yha xuu7a uzhiz wode ubbayid Goday ye7od hellodayis E yhayiqa ododa.<verse eid="1CO 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Yeyi gishos, beezoowa oger Goday boora miiz woy Goday xuu7a uzhiz oonkka eez ashannee suutha toochcheez gishos fa nagarayis oycinttiza. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Zini as fana faacco. Yeezii boora muyee; xuu7ayppekka uzho. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Goday ashaybagga shaakkii erekka, boora miikonnee xuu7aypp uzhiko, faal afa pirdda shiishiza. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Yeyi gishos, yi ganccepp gaamitay daabureeza; harggintteeza; ma gaame asitay yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Zini nu nuna paacii be7eezi baz maaqqeezako, nuul afa pirddinttamii. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Alame pirddinttiza wode nu alamayra pirddinttaamay garkk yhatti Goday nuna seeriza.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Yeyi gishos, ta ishuntho, Goday kaho maadayis yi shiiqiza wode woli naagoytta. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Yi shiiqay pirddas maaqqaamay garkk nayintteez oonkka yeziko, fa kara muye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:34">Atteezibaz taanii ged yhanigii yinttis ododa.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Geeshsha Ayyana imotita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Ta ishuntho, Geeshsha Ayyana imotitay bazkka yi eroday garkk ta koyiza. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Yi Xooss ammanoowa wode doona baa eeqako gooshintti, yi erowazitayirakka yhanigeezana yi eriza. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Xooss Ayyanay kaalithiza as oonkka, «Yesuus qanggintto» yeegooya. Ma Geeshsha Ayyanay kaalithekkazin, oonkka, «Yesuus Goda» godayis danda7oozana yi eroday garkk ta koyiza.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Duma duma Ayyana imotitay yeza, zin imotita inggiza Ayyanay petta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6-8">Oro. 12:6-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Nu Godayis oothiza duma duma oositay yeza, zin Goday petta. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Nu Godayis oothiza duma duma ogitay yeza, zin ye ogayir as ubbayir oothiz Xoossay petta. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Zini pettayis pettayis inggintteez qonccith imotitay wolla maaddinttoday garkk.<verse eid="1CO 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Geeshsha Ayyanay pettayis ecetithi kumeez qaala inggiza; ma pettayis eratithii kumeez qaala inggiza. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Ye Geeshsha Ayyanay pettayis ammano, yhankkayis ma pathiza wolqqa inggiza. <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Geeshsha Ayyanay pettayis malata oothiza wolqqa, pettayis tinbbite odiza wolqqa inggiza. Pettayis ayyanapp ayyana shaakkii eriza wolqqa, pettayis duma duma doonar odiza wolqqa, ma pettayis duma duma doonar odintteezana billiz wolqqa inggiza. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Zini yha ubba oothizay ye pettii Geeshsha Ayyana. E koyeezay garkk pettayis pettayis asayis duma duma imota inggiza.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pettii asetithal duma duma billitita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Pettii asetithal gaame billititay yeza, zin ye duma duma billititay pettii asetithi maaqqiza. Yey garkkekka, Kiristtoosa duma duma billititay yez pettii asetith garkke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:4-5">Oro. 12:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Nuunii Ayihude maaqqin Girike maaqqin aylle maaqqin womaanno maaqqin, ubbay pettii asetith maaqqodayis Geeshsha Ayyanar xammaqqintteeza. Ma nu ubbay pettii Geeshsha Ayyana ekkeeza.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Nu asetithal duma duma billititay yezapp attin pettii billite aadda baaya. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Tokay, «Taanii kushe maaqqekka gishos billite baaya» giiko, E yeya geez gishos billitetithay attinnee? <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Haye, «Taanii aafe maaqqekka gishos billite baaya» giiko, E yeya geez gishos asetithapp pettii billite maaqqithay attinennee? <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Asetith ubbay aafe aadda maaqqiko, nu abar si7odee? Ma asetithi ubbay haye aadda maaqqiko nu abar singgode?<verse eid="1CO 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Zini Xoossay fa koyeezay garkk, asetith gancce duma duma billitita gaddeeza. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Ubbay pettii billite maaqqeezako asetithii anapp benttode? <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Zini billititay gaame maaqqikokka, asetithay petto.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Aafe kusheko, «Ne taas koshshooya» godayis danda7ooya, woy omma toheko, «Ne taas beezooya» godayis danda7ooya. <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Zini daabura aaziz asetith billititay nuus usa koshshiza. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Bonchcho koshshoowa gi nu qoppiza nu billitita lo7ith bonchchoda. Ma nu borssinttiza nu asetith billitita aathii bonchchii naagoda. <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>Nu bi7in borssowa asetith billitayis bonchcho koshshooya. Zini Xoossay nu asetith billitita woli hellith borssiza billitayis aadhiz bonchcho inggeeza. <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>Asetith billititay pettay pettayir shaako medhdhekka woli qoppoday garkk udii medheeza. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Asetith billititaypp pettay hargginttiko billititay ubbay ezar hargginttiza. Asetith billititaypp pettay bonchchinttiko billititay ubbay ezar ufayttiza.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Yi ubbay Kiristtoosa asetithi; ma yi pettay pettay E billitita. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Woosa keetha Xoossay, tiina hawaarita, nam7intho nabita, hayidzintha asitamaarita, kaallii malatita oothizita, pathizita, yhankkita maaddizita, woosa keeth aqizitannee, duma duma doonar odizita gaddeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:11">Efi. 4:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Ubbay hawaare? Ubbay nabe? Ubbay asitamaare? Ubbay malata udine? <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Ubbay pathinee? Ubbay duma duma doonar odinttinee? Ubbay duma duma doonar odinttizana bili7inee? <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Zini ubbaypp aadhiz imota miinthii koyoytta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Ma ubbaypp aadhiz oga ta yinttan beezoda.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Tuma siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Taanii as doonarannee kiitanchcho doonar odinttodayis danda7ikokka, taas siiqo dhabiko, giiriz daala woy ooshiz woorlle garkke. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Tinbbite odiz imota taas yezikoka, xuura ubba erikokka, eratithii ubbay yezikoka, ma amba denthii hara aqo kanggiza ammano taas yezikoka, siiqo dhabiko, ta cer haniza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat. 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:21">21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mar. 11:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Taas yeza baz ubba manqqos inggikokka, hara attozin, tana tamas aathii inggikokka, siiqo dhabiko tana akkokka adamii.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Siiqo danda7iza. Siiqo keeha. Siiqo qanatooya. Siiqo ceeqinttooya. Siiqo utirttooya. <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>Siiqo beezowabaz oothooya. Siiqo uuzattooya. Siiqo yilotooya. Siiqo qoho payidooya. <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Siiqo tumar ufayttinepp attin worzher ufayttooya. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Siiqo ubba danda7iza; ubba ammaniza; lo77o baz hanoda gi, ufayisar naagiza; ubba bazar miinggiza.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Siiqo wurssithii hellodayis dhabooya. Zini tinbbite attoda; duma duma doonar odinttizay attoda; eratithaykka aadhoda. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Nu eratithapp laafa eriza; tinbbitepp bagga odiza. <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>Zini folo maaqqeezay ye7eez wode folo baazay attoda.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Taanii na7azar na7a garkk nashshiza; na7a garkk qoppiza; na7a garkk akaakiza. Ta wozinaama maaqqeez wode na7atith hana ashsheeza. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Yhatti poo7o baa aqo masttooter bi7izay garkk nu bi7iza, zin ye wode nu qonccer be7ada. Yhatti nu eretithapp xiqqa eriza, zin ye wode Xoossay nuna erizay garkk folo eroda.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Yikkee, ammano, ufayssinnee siiqo, yha hayidzitay eqqii yezoda. Zin yhayttitaypp aadhizay siiqo.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Tinbbitennee duma duma doonar odintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Siiqo kaalloytta. Ayyana imotita miinthii koyoytta; ubbapp aathii, tinbbite imota miinthii koyoytta. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Duma duma doonar odinttiza asii Xoossayis odizapp attin asis odooya. Zini asis qonccekka xuura Ayyana wolqqar odinttiza gishos oonkka E odinttizana akaakooya. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Zini tinbbite odizitay as dichchodayis, minthathodayisinnee xaalisodayis asis odiza. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Duma duma doonar odiza as fana dichchiza. Zini tinbbite odiza as woosa keeth dichchiza.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Yi ubbay duma duma doonar odinttizako ta dosiza, zin tinbbite odizako ta usa dosiza. Duma duma doonar odinttizana woosa keeth dichchis bili7iz as dhabiko, duma duma doona odinttizaypp tinbbite odizay aadhiza.<verse eid="1CO 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Zin ta ishuntho, taanii yinttiko yhanigii qonccithar woy eratithar woy tinbbite odor woy timirtte bayth duma duma doonar odenttiko yinttan ab maaddodee? <verse eid="1CO 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Duma duma yeth miishayis pettii girssi yeziko, shulishulo girssinne diith girssi wayizii shaakkii erodee? <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Ma tulitulo pugo shaakkii erinttaam ixxiko olas giiginttizay oonoo? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Yey garkkekka, duma duma doonar yi odinttizay qoncce maaqqaam ixxiko yi odiza oonii erodee? Yeyi carkkor odinttizay garkke.<verse eid="1CO 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Yha alamel gaame doonitay yeza; ye ubbayis bili7ithii yeza. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Zini pettii as odinttiza doona taanii eraam ixxiko E taas imathe maaqqiza; taakka ees imathe maaqqiza. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Yey garkkekka, Geeshsha Ayyana imota yi ekkodayis miinthii koyko, woosa keeth dichchayis ubbapp aadhiz imota koyoytta.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Duma duma doonar odinttiza as fa oda bilodayis birshshith imotay ingginttoday garkk Xooss woosso. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Taanii duma duma doonar Xooss woossiko, ta ayyanay woossiza, zin ta wozinay akkokka maadinttooya. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Yeezin, ta ab oothodayis koshshee? Taanii ta ayyanar woosiza; ta kahayirakka woosiza. Taanii ta ayyanar yexxiza; ta kahayirakka yexxiza. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Yeya maaqqaam ixxiko neenii ne ayyanar Xooss galatiza wode ye aqayid neenii giza erekka as ne galatiza wode, «Amin77ii» gode? <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Neenii Xooss galatizay lo77o, zin hara as maaddooya.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Ta yi ubbaypp aathii duma duma doonar odinttiza gishos Xooss galatiza. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Zini taanii woosa keetha harita tamaarssodayis duma duma doonar taphphii mukulo qaala odinttizaypp erinttiza doonar ichchin qaala odo dosiza.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Ta ishuntho, yi iita qofas na7itay garkk maaqqoyttap attin qopar na7a maaqqipatte wozinaamita maaqqoytta. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Goday, Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">«Taanii yha asayis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">duma duma doonar odinttiza asayirannee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">imath doonar odinttiza asayir odiza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">Zini yeyi haninikka tana si7ooya» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:11-12">Isa. 28:11-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Yikkee, duma duma doonar oday, ammanoowa asayis malla maaqqinepp attin ammaniza asayis baaya. Tinbbite ammaniza asayis malla maaqqinepp attin ammanoowa asayis baaya.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Woosa keeth asay pettipp shiiqeez wode ubbay duma duma doonar odinttiko eroowa woy ammanoowa asay yi shiiqo yi7ii, «Yhayttitay eeyiza» goosane? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Zini eroowa woy ammanoowa asay woosa keeth geliza wode asay tinbbite ododar, si7iko fa nagara akaakoda; ma E si7eez qaalayid pirddinttoda. <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>Unttii e wozina geemmeez qofa qonccisoda. Yey garkkekka, «Tuma Xoossay yi gancce yeza» yeegii markkattii, xuggunii Xoossayis goynnoda.<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goynno woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Ta ishuntho, nu waago? Yi pettipp shiiqiza wode pettayis mazmuure yeza; pettayis taamarsso imotay yeza; pettayis qonccithii yeza; pettayis duma duma doonar odintto yeza; pettayis bili7iz imotay yeza. Ye ubbay woosa keethana dichchizabaz maaqqodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Duma duma doonar odinttiza asitay yeziko, nam7e woy ganggiko hayidz maaqqiko maarar maarar naaginttii ododayis beeziza. Unttii odinttizana hara as billo. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Zini billiz as dhabiko, duma duma doonar odinttizay woosa keetha si77i go. Faasinnee fa Xoossayis odo.<verse eid="1CO 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Tinbbite odizitay nam7e woy hayidz maaqqii odo. Ma yhankkitay unttii gizibaz shaakko. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Ye shiiqayid yez hara asis pettibaz qoncciko tiina odinttizay si77i go. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Ubbay tamaaroday garkkennee ubbay miinggoday garkk maarar maarar tinbbite ododayis danda7iza. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Nabitay ayyanay nabitayis azazinttiza. <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>Xoossay sarotith Xoossapp attin cabbo Xooss baaya. Geeshshitay woosa keethitay ubbay yey garkke.<verse eid="1CO 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>Maachchitay woosa keeth shiiqo si77i go. Higge gizay garkk unttii haarinttopp attin woosa keetha ododayis unttis mawute baaya. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Maachchitay woosa keetha odintto borsso maaqqeez gishos pettii pettibaz erodayis koyko kara fa azina oyco.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Xooss qaala tiina yi ke7eenee? Woy Xooss qaalay yi aaddako ye7eenee? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Oonkka fana nabe woy fana Xooss as gi qoppiko, taanii yinttis xaafeezay Goday azazo maaqqeezana akaako. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Zini oonkka eraam ixxiko eekka erinttippe.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Yeyi gishos, ta ishuntho, tinbbite ododayis miinthii amottoytta; ma duma duma doonar odinttaka kayppate. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Zini ubbaykka wogarannee maarar maaqqo.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa yhayiqopp denddo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Ta ishuntho, ta yinttis markkatteez Wonggile yi ekkeezannee yi ammanayid miinggii eqqeezana yi akaakoday garkk ta koyiza. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Ta taamarsseez Wonggile miinthii aykkiko yi ezayir attoda. Yeyi hanaam ixxiko yi ammanay cere maaqqada.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Taanii ekkeez ubbaypp aadhiz kiita tiinatii yinttis inggeeza. Yeykka, Geeshsha Maxaafay gizay garkk, Kiristtoosa nu nagara gishos yhayqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5-12">Isa. 53:5-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>Moogintteeza; Geeshsha Maxaafay gizay garkk, hayidzintha gallas yhayiqopp dendeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-10">Maz. 16:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat. 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:24-32">Haw. O. 2:24-32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>Phixiroosas qoncceeza. Yeypp guye, taphpho nam7i hawaaritayis bentteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16-17">Mat. 28:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14">Mar. 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:34">Luq. 24:34</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:36">36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19">Wan. 20:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Ichchin xeetapp gaanggiza ammanizitayis pettii toke bentteeza. Unttapp gaamitay yhanno hellodayis paxa yeza, zin xiqqitay yhayqqeeza. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Yeypp guye, Yayqqoobas bentteeza; zuleppekka fa hawaaritayis ubbayis bentteeza.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Ma wurssitha bullith garkk maaqqeez taas bentteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Haw. O. 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Taanii Yesuusa hawaaritay ubbaypp laafa. Taanii Xooss woosa keeth bayi7itheez gishos Yesuusa hawaare ginttinttii xeeginttodayis beezowaza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Haw. O. 8:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Zini Xooss aadho keehatithayid yhatti maaqqeezay tana; E taas inggeez aadho keehatithay cer attekkaya. Taanii yhankko hawaaritaypp aathii daabureeza. Zini taara yez Xooss aadho keehatithay ootheenepp attin tana baaya. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Yikkee, tana maaqqin unttii, nu ubbay tamaarssizay yeya; yinttikka ye kiita ammaneeza.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yhayiqopp denddo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Kiristtoosa yhayiqopp denddeezana nu sabbakiza wode yinttipp pettay pettay yeezin, wayizii, «Yhayiqopp denddo baaya» yeeginee? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Yhayiqopp denddo baabaz maaqqiko Kiristtoosa yhayiqopp denddekka guusii. <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>Kiristtoosa yhayiqopp denddekkabaz maaqqiko nu timirttaykka yi ammanaykka cere. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Yhayiqopp denddo baazin, nuunii Xoossay, «Kiristtoosana yhayiqopp dentheeza» yeegii sabbakittar wordo Xooss markkitta maaqqeez guussii. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Yhayqqeez asay yhayiqopp dendowabaz maaqqiko yikkee, Kiristtoosa yhayiqopp denddekkaya. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Kiristtoosa yhayiqopp denddekkabaz maaqqiko, yi ammanay cere; ma yi yhanno hellodayis yi nagarara yeza. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Yikkee, Kiristtoosa ammanii yhayqqeezitaykka dhabeeza guussii. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Nuunii yha alame yess aaddas Kiristtoosar ufayssa ootheezibaz maaqqiko, yha sa7all yez as ubbaypp nubazi aadho azanthizabaz maaqqada.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Zini Kiristtoosa yhayqqeezitayis yhayiqopp dendor bayra maaqqii tuma dendeeza. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Yhayiqo pettii as baggar yha alame ye7ezay garkk yhayiqopp dendokka pettii as baggar ye7eeza. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Addaame baggar as ubbay yhayqqeezay garkk Kiristtoosa baggar as ubbay de7o yeziza. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Zini pettay pettay fa muurar muurar dendoda. Kiristtoosa ubbaypp bayiratii dendeeza; yeypp guye, Kiristtoosasitay E yi7iza wode dendoda.<verse eid="1CO 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Yeypp guye, Kiristtoosa haarizita, mawutennee wolqqa ubba dhabisii, kaatetitha Xooss Adayis inggiza wode wode wurssithay ye7oda. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Xoossay e morkkita ubba e toke oommo olod hellodayis Kiristtoosa kawutodayis beeziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Wurssithal E dhabisodayis yez morkkay yhayiqo. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Xoossay ubba baz e mawute oommo haariseeza» ginttinttii xaafintteeza. Zini ubba e mawutaypp oommo haariseeza gizay, Xooss Aday aadda attiko ubba baz e mawutaypp oommo haariseeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Maz. 8:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Ubba baz Kiristtoosa mawutaypp oommo haarintteezaypp guye Kiristtoosa ma fa ommas ubba baz paas haariseez Xoossayis haarinttoda. Ye wode Xoossay fa aadda ubba haaroda.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Yhayqqeezitay dendowabaz maaqqiko u gishos xammaqinttiza asay abis waayinee? Yhayqqeezitay dendowabaz maaqqiko yeezin, abis, asay yhayqqeezitay gishos xammaqinttinee?<verse eid="1CO 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Yeezin, nuunii abis ubba wode nunatitha metos aathii ingginee? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Ta ishuntho, ta gallas gallas yhayiqos aadhii ingginttiza. Yeykka, Goda Yesuus kiristtoosal yez de7o pettipettiethayid yinttal ceeqqiza gishosii. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>As qof agarkk maaqqiko, taanii Efesoone do7ara butiteezay tana ab maaddee? Yhayqqeezitay yhayiqopp dendowabaz maaqqiko, «Wonttii nu yhayqqiz gishos yhayino maada uzhoda» yeegiz asay garkk maaqqiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Isa. 22:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Balinttipate! Iita zhametithii lo77o hano iissiza. <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Yi kahayiko maaqqoytta. Nagara oothipate. Yinttapp pettii pettii asay Xooss erooya. Taanii yinttan yeellathodayis yeya giza.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Denddo asetithi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Pettii asii, «Yhayqqeez asay wayizii denddee? Unttii ab garkk asetithara ye7odee?» yeegith attaamii. <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Neno boozayyo, neenii biittal zeriz zerithay yhayqqekka dolooya. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Neenii zerizay gistte maaqqo woy hara katha wooqqoowa aafa aadda zerinepp attin doleez dola baaya. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Zini Xoossay zerethitayis fa doseezay garkk medhetithii inggiza. Duma duma zerithitayis duma duma asetithi inggiza. <verse eid="1CO 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Medhetith ubbay asho petto baaya. Zini as asho petto; mehe asho hara; kafitay asho hara; ma molo ashokka hara.<verse eid="1CO 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Salo asetithii yeza; ma sa7a asetithikka yeza. Zini salo asetith bonchcho pettii mala; ma sa7a asetith bonchcho hara. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Awa bonchcho hara; agina bonchcho hara; xoolinttitay bonchcho hara; pettii xoolinttay hara xoolinttopp bonchchor dummatiza.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Yhayqqeezitay yhayiqopp denddiza wode yey garkk hanoda. Wooqqiza asetithay zerinttiza; wooqqoowa asetithi maaqqii denddiza. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>Toochcher zerinttii, bonchchor dendoda; daaburisar zerinttii, wolqqar dendoda. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Medhetith asetithar zerinttii, ayyana asetithi maaqqii dendoda. Medheta asetithii yeziko, ayyana asetithi yeza.<verse eid="1CO 15:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Yey garkkekka, Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Tiina athay, Addaama, path yez as maaqqii medhintteeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Medhe. 2:7</ref></char></note> yeegiza. Zini guye Addaama, Kiristtoosa, de7o inggiza ayyana maaqqeeza. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Zini medheta as tiina yi7in, guyepp ayyana as ye7eenepp attin ayyana as tiina ye7ekkaya. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Tiina Addaam biittapp medhintteez biitta as; nam7intho Addaama salopp ye7eeza. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Biittapp medhintteezitay biittaypp medhintteezana aaziza. Saloositay salopp ye7eezana aaziza. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Nuunii biittapp medhintteez atha aazizay garkk salopp ye7eez athakka aaziza.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Ta ishuntho, ta gizay yeya; ashonnee suuthii Xooss kaatetith laattodayis danda7ooya. Wooqqiza asetithay wooqqoowa asetitha laattooya.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Ta yinttis pettii xuure ododa. Nu ubbay yhayqqaamii, zin wurssithal ubbay laaminttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:51-52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1 Tes. 4:15-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>Tulitulo puginttodar aafe qiphii be7adayis qoppekka laaminttoda. Yhayqqeez asay wooqqaam as maaqqii dendoda; nuukka laaminttoda. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Yhay wooqqizay wooqqaamana, yhayi yhayqqizay yhayqqaamana ma77odayis beeziza.<verse eid="1CO 15:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Yhay wooqqizay wooqqaamana, ma yhayi yhayqqizay yhayqqaamana ma77iza wode Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Yhayiqo gamithar mitintteeza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Isa. 25:8</ref></char></note> giz qaalay polinttoda. <verse eid="1CO 15:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>Yey garkkekka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">«Yhayiqo, ne gamithay aba yenee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">Yhayiqo, ne yiishshay aba yenee?»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hosa. 13:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Yhayiqo dukkiza yiishshay nagara; ma nagara wolqqay higge. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Zini nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar nuus gamith inggiza Xoossana galata hello.<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Yeyi gishos, ta siiqo ishuntho, eni7ekka miinggii eqqoytta. Goday oosayid yi daaburizay cere baazana erii ubba wode Goday oosa azallekkazar oothoytta.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammaniza Asayis shiiqeez tam7e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Ammaniza asayis miisha shiisho bagga Galata woosa keethitayis taanii azazeezay garkk yinttikka oothoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:25-26">Oro. 15:25-26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Miishe shiisho ta yinttiko yhanigodar maaqqaamay garkk pettay pettay saaminttapp tiina gallas, wogga wode wogga wode fa denggiza bazapp kessii fa kara gantho. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Taanii ged yhanigeez wode miishe Yerusalaame helthoday garkk yi dooreez asayis dabddaabbe inggii unttan Yerusalaame azazoda. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Unttar tana yhamo beeziza baz maaqqiko unttii taara yhanigodayis danda7iza.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa qofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Taanii Maqadoonar aadhodayis qoppeez gishos ged yhanigii yinttiko ye7oda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Haw. O. 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Ta yhanigiza aqo ana maaqqikokka, ta yhamayid yi tana maaddoday garkk yi kale xiqqa wode gam7ekka attaamii. Barigo aginita yi kale aatho waayii ashshoda. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Taanii ogera aadhittar yinttan be7adayis koyooya. Goday giiko, yi kale unddenna wode katam7odayis qoppiza.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Zini taanii Phenxeqosxe Baale hellodayis Efesoona gam7oda. <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>Taas ooso kumeeza dalgge peenggay dooyintteeza, zin gaame eqinttiza morkkitay yeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lewii. 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Nam7i. 16:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:8-10">Haw. O. 19:8-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>E ta garkk Goda ooso oothiza as maaqqeez gishos Ximaatoosa yinttiko yhanigiko, yi kale E yashittekkazar yezoday garkk oothoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:17">1 Qor. 4:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Oonkka eza kadhippe. E taako saro maaqqoday garkk eza maaddii moyzoytta. Taanii E yhankko ammanizitayir maaqqodana naagiza.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Nu isha Aphphiloosa yhankko ammanizitayir yinttiko yhammaday garkk ta eza miinthii woosseeza. Yhatti yinttiko yhanigodayis koyekkaya, zin ees giigeez wode yinttiko yhammada.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith zorennee sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Barkkoytta; Ammanor eqqoytta; xaaloytta; miinggoytta. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Ooso ubba siiqor oothoytta.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Ta ishuntho, Isxifaanosennee e kara asay Akkaya biitta unttii tiina ammaneezita maaqqeezannee ammanizita maaddodayis fana aathii inggeezana yi eriza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:16">1 Qor. 1:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>Yinttikka u garkk asisinnee, unttara oosor daaburiza ubbayis kiitenttoday garkk ta yinttan woosiza.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Isxifaanosa, Firdonaaxisennee Akkayqoosa taako ye7eezay tana ufaysseeza. Yi baa aqo unttii yinttan maaqqii ta paca kuntheeza. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Unttii yinttan ufaysseezay garkk tanakka ufaysseeza. Yey garkk asita denthithoytta.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Iisa woosa keeth asay yinttan saro giza. Aqilannee Phirisqila fa kara shiiqiza woosa keeth asayira pettipp yinttan Goday sunthayir sarotheeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Haw. O. 18:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Ammaniza ishitay ubbay yinttan saro yeegiza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:20">Geesh yeerintto yeerinttittar woli sarothoytta. <verse eid="1CO 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Taanii, Phawuloosa, yha sarotha ta kusher xaafeeza.<verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Goda dosowa as yeziko, baadintteeza maaqqo. Nu Godayyo, yhana ye7oba!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatithay yinttar maaqqo.<verse eid="1CO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Ta siiqqay Kiristtoosa Yesuusar yez yi ubbayira maaqqo. Amin77ii.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
